XML contains all tables within 5SH2D firmware. Use ECUFLASH to edit. Checksums must be corrected before flashing a modified firmware. Capacity changes are not part of this XML. There are two duplicate calibrations and both must match or the firmware will not boot. 40KWH and 62KWH protocols are different and are not compatible. There are other differences between 40kwh firmwares that will cause DTC's in the VCM and the car will not drive. Further investigation is required.

